  message: "Fixed in WIP PR. Yesod framework added (detection via yesod/yesod-core/yesod-auth/yesod-persistent deps + yesod.yaml with mkYesod/parseRoutes/Warp/typeclass/handler-convention patterns). The other three frameworks mentioned in the original ticket (http4s, play, flask-appbuilder) already had YAML patterns in the repo — only Yesod was missing. 3 tests cover *.cabal detection, package.yaml detection, and yaml schema validity."  # 225a
